    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92950" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥῶπος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>petty wares</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅστις ῥῶπον ἐξάγει χθονός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					263
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ῥ. ὃν σὺ περιφέρεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Diph.
					55
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄπρατον εἶναι τὸν ῥ</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				D.
				34.9
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔλαιον καὶ ἄλλον ναυτικὸν
			ῥ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mir.</u>
				844a19
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑαλᾶ σκεύη καὶ ἄλλος ῥ. τοιοῦτος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					4.5.3
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				8.6.16
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεῖγμα χρώματος</span>
			, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Abst.</u>
				4.3
			</span></i>.</div>
